    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/5f1b02bb4cab16ea86386858411e2955.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/0385959a45be3abb316940a25db8a9b6.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LUST Company</strong> \ud83d\udc7e is an exciting visual novel where you take on the role of the captain of a space crew trapped by dangerous space pirates. Your mission? Rebuild your ship, rescue your crew, and escape before it\u2019s too late. But be careful\u2014every choice you make could lead to unexpected consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/e34f659efdfe1f28fe610d23327e2a72.poster.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/e34f659efdfe1f28fe610d23327e2a72.webm?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/e34f659efdfe1f28fe610d23327e2a72.mp4?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gather the resources you need, complete quests, monitor the ship\u2019s security cameras for threats, and interact with your crew to uncover their secrets. Manage limited resources and search for parts to repair the ship. Your decisions will shape the story, and it\u2019s up to you whether you can get out of this cosmic mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/bde11c1a4d6848ddc8cb9eddf11eeb6a.webp?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/f4c03f57e1fd80822f183cbd9fcf68a2.poster.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/f4c03f57e1fd80822f183cbd9fcf68a2.webm?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/f4c03f57e1fd80822f183cbd9fcf68a2.mp4?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/70ebc8010b35a7fd664237c6ace17f29.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/ae08ae39ef8c0ed85c88fa3fbf2d7482.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral choices that affect the story and lead to different endings<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/efbe3be8fbdf7f300cf231e4992afa5a.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adult content that brings in intimate moments and temptations into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/4e1205a357e8e9f6b9941bfea84a2f2b.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic storyline that changes based on the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/4d2932edea3d6eb87c46b1f1de40b0cb.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games that challenge your logic and strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/f3d64f7923fbad3f7d98cc9e4e24ebbb.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogues that let you choose how to talk and interact with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/d33e0de1325e96976fcc31d0709261c2.webp?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=56 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/10117dbe94cbefc4af921ab4514d5c9d.poster.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/10117dbe94cbefc4af921ab4514d5c9d.webm?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/10117dbe94cbefc4af921ab4514d5c9d.mp4?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/2397046f8042fecd80553baae4eb2762.avif?t=1755536824\" width=590 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LUST Company</strong> \ud83d\udc7e is a space adventure where every choice counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/5f1b02bb4cab16ea86386858411e2955.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/0385959a45be3abb316940a25db8a9b6.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LUST Company</strong> \ud83d\udc7e is an exciting visual novel where you take on the role of the captain of a space crew trapped by dangerous space pirates. Your mission? Rebuild your ship, rescue your crew, and escape before it\u2019s too late. But be careful\u2014every choice you make could lead to unexpected consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/e34f659efdfe1f28fe610d23327e2a72.poster.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/e34f659efdfe1f28fe610d23327e2a72.webm?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/e34f659efdfe1f28fe610d23327e2a72.mp4?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gather the resources you need, complete quests, monitor the ship\u2019s security cameras for threats, and interact with your crew to uncover their secrets. Manage limited resources and search for parts to repair the ship. Your decisions will shape the story, and it\u2019s up to you whether you can get out of this cosmic mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/bde11c1a4d6848ddc8cb9eddf11eeb6a.webp?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/f4c03f57e1fd80822f183cbd9fcf68a2.poster.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/f4c03f57e1fd80822f183cbd9fcf68a2.webm?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/f4c03f57e1fd80822f183cbd9fcf68a2.mp4?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/70ebc8010b35a7fd664237c6ace17f29.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/ae08ae39ef8c0ed85c88fa3fbf2d7482.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral choices that affect the story and lead to different endings<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/efbe3be8fbdf7f300cf231e4992afa5a.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adult content that brings in intimate moments and temptations into the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/4e1205a357e8e9f6b9941bfea84a2f2b.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic storyline that changes based on the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/4d2932edea3d6eb87c46b1f1de40b0cb.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games that challenge your logic and strategic thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/f3d64f7923fbad3f7d98cc9e4e24ebbb.webp?t=1755536824\" width=597 height=61 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive dialogues that let you choose how to talk and interact with others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/d33e0de1325e96976fcc31d0709261c2.webp?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=56 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/10117dbe94cbefc4af921ab4514d5c9d.poster.avif?t=1755536824\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/10117dbe94cbefc4af921ab4514d5c9d.webm?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/10117dbe94cbefc4af921ab4514d5c9d.mp4?t=1755536824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3426450/extras/2397046f8042fecd80553baae4